jpl-debias-2018 packages an unmodified data file obtained from the NASA/JPL
Solar System Dynamics service:

  https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/ftp/ssd/debias/debias_2018.tgz

The MIT license in LICENSE applies to the packaging code and documentation
created by B612 Asteroid Institute. It does not purport to relicense the JPL
source data. The upstream archive contains no explicit license file. The data
and upstream README are redistributed with source attribution and exact
content hashes; downstream users should confirm that their use complies with
applicable NASA/JPL data policies.

The upstream README credits Eggl et al. (2020, Icarus) for details of the
catalog-debiasing method.
